      <p>Critical slowing down raises the lag-1 autocorrelation <inline-formula><mml:math id="m1" alttext="\rho_1"><mml:msub><mml:mi>ρ</mml:mi><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:msub></mml:math></inline-formula> of a time series <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="r1">[1]</xref>.</p>
      <sec id="s1a">
        <title>Variance</title>
        <p>Variance also grows as the recovery rate <inline-formula><tex-math>\lambda</tex-math></inline-formula> approaches zero.</p>
